      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet%2C_Louisiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Violet began as an early 18th‑century French and Spanish settlement, later turning into a sugar‑cane hub before the Civil War.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
