    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Violet sits on the historic Mississippi River, sharing the region’s deep agricultural and fishing traditions.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://scientificmagz.blog/violet-louisiana-parish-secrets"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 2005, Hurricane Katrina’s storm surge toppled Violet’s levee and destroyed the MRGO canal, devastating the community.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
