      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet%2C_Louisiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Violet is slated to host the Louisiana International Terminal, a project that would let the world’s largest container ships berth on the lower Mississippi.",
